{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d664f013b8601b7cabc745f7a8ef1b9.avif?t=1774429080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/2d664f013b8601b7cabc745f7a8ef1b9.webp?t=1774429080 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.poster.avif?t=1774429080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.webm?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.mp4?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominus Automa is an automated IDLE multiplayer RPG created for players who love deep progression systems but no longer have time for endless grinding. Your hero lives on the server 24/7 - training, fighting, and progressing even while you are offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/814d5aa62f808c606042f2db3d734865.avif?t=1774429080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/814d5aa62f808c606042f2db3d734865.webp?t=1774429080 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1ad64a1c0e17764824c277cd6da7642f.poster.avif?t=1774429080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1ad64a1c0e17764824c277cd6da7642f.webm?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1ad64a1c0e17764824c277cd6da7642f.mp4?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You define everything: combat style, priorities, reactions to danger, and long-term goals. Through smart automation, your hero acts independently, following the logic you design - from resource farming to tactical combat decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/6c3f8f3f47ca089f458b028d16e3908d.avif?t=1774429080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/6c3f8f3f47ca089f458b028d16e3908d.webp?t=1774429080 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.poster.avif?t=1774429080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.webm?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.mp4?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a truly persistent MMO world. Other players can encounter your hero during their own adventures, see them in action, and interact with them. Hundreds of autonomous characters continuously shape the world, whether their creators are online or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2581880dd53c0f3f519117a0c4d29c73.avif?t=1774429080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/2581880dd53c0f3f519117a0c4d29c73.webp?t=1774429080 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.poster.avif?t=1774429080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.webm?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.mp4?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft powerful items, and build your place in the world through a smart, player-driven economy. Every decision influences your hero\u2019s growth and long-term success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/0eeaf63d8cb30f9bb4cf81ebf425eae0.avif?t=1774429080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/0eeaf63d8cb30f9bb4cf81ebf425eae0.webp?t=1774429080 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.poster.avif?t=1774429080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.webm?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.mp4?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in control wherever you are. Check your hero\u2019s progress, adjust priorities, and issue commands remotely - even from your phone. With voice commands, you can guide your character hands-free in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/311582dd58eec3d0b2bb262389e38622.avif?t=1774429080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/311582dd58eec3d0b2bb262389e38622.webp?t=1774429080 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1ad64a1c0e17764824c277cd6da7642f.poster.avif?t=1774429080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1ad64a1c0e17764824c277cd6da7642f.webm?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1ad64a1c0e17764824c277cd6da7642f.mp4?t=1774429080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominus Automa</strong> delivers full-scale MMO systems without the pressure of daily play sessions. It is designed for grown-up players who want to plan, decide, and watch their strategies unfold - on their own schedule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re commuting, working, or just chilling -\u00a0<strong>your hero keeps fighting. Your world keeps moving.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/bb13adeb9cef768f5f57f607d6785a6f.avif?t=1774429080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/bb13adeb9cef768f5f57f607d6785a6f.webp?t=1774429080 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795810?t=1774429080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795810?t=1774429080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/8784c44d6853c16f58f035e0d8fabc9d5efa6738/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774429080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/8784c44d6853c16f58f035e0d8fabc9d5efa6738/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774429080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d664f013b8601b7cabc745f7a8ef1b9.avif?t=1774429080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/2d664f013b8601b7cabc745f7a8ef1b9.webp?t=1774429080 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pl